This made me wonder whether a dialog is necessary in the first place, at least for the time being given the priority attached in this issue thread. It would be multiple times easier to just perform a save automatically for the previous skin on skin change, especially since it can be done without going through the issue of having to revert back to previous skin.

cc @ppy/team-client
